flowchart LR
  U[User] --> UI[Local browser UI]
  U --> CLI[Local CLI]
  UI --> API[FastAPI on loopback]
  CLI --> PARSE[PDF / DOCX / TXT parser]
  API --> PARSE
  PARSE --> RT[Resume text in memory]
  UI --> JD[Job description text]
  CLI --> JD
  RT --> TAX[Explicit skill alias dictionary]
  JD --> TAX
  TAX --> EVID[Skill matches + source excerpts]
  RT --> TFIDF[TF-IDF cosine overlap]
  JD --> TFIDF
  EVID --> SCORE[Weighted, explainable alignment rubric]
  TFIDF --> SCORE
  SCORE --> REC[Missing-skill review + truthful resume suggestions]
  REC --> UI
  REC --> CLI
  API -. no persistence .-> PRIV[No disk storage / no external model call]
